"The Triplanets are the Artonans' three home worlds: Artona I, Artona II and Artona III."
"Artona I is the Mother, the mother planet; at first only it and Artona II existed."
"The Artonan Triplanetary Government rules them and made the 1963 agreement with Earth."
"Earth is an Artonan resource world, owing the Triplanets Avowed as contract servants."
"The Triplanets hold nearly thirty-five billion people and no monarchies today."
"About twenty percent of Artonans are wizards; the other eighty percent cannot vote or hold office."
"The air on any of the Artonas is warm and damp and smells faintly of mildew."
"Artonans keep indoor temperatures just shy of ninety degrees Fahrenheit."
"Rabbits often work on the Triplanets as assistants and errand-runners for Artonans."
"The Ryeh-b't, a small flying reptile from Artona III, is a popular pet across the Triplanets."
"Hot labs on the Triplanets make magical bombs."
"Triplanet pharmacies won't sell products not designed for a buyer's species."
"Kimnor, a planet with the moon Thegund, orbits in the same solar system as the Mother."
